lib.rs
	Root module re-exporting astar, geo, graph, parser, router, and rules modules.
astar.rs
	Bidirectional A* ("meet in the middle") router with consistent heuristics, strategy profiles, and turn penalties.
geo.rs
	Geodesic calculations, projection onto line segments, and spherical bearing computation.
graph.rs
	GraphNode, GraphEdge, NodeEntry, and StreetGraph data structures with graph merging.
parser.rs
	Overpass OSM JSON response parsing into StreetGraph adjacency list and mock graph generation.
router.rs
	BinaryHeap Dijkstra pathfinding, multi-strategy cost functions, turn penalties, and route statistics.
rules.rs
	OSM tag mapping to infrastructure types, road classes, traffic controls, and surface types.
